On 07/10/2014 04:03 AM, Peng Haitao wrote:
> The function inet_pton() is thread safe with exceptions.
> 
> Signed-off-by: Peng Haitao <penght-BthXqXjhjHXQFUHtdCDX3A@public.gmane.org>
